WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.888
Some dreams are forgotten because they are too heavy to carry.

00:00:41.190 --> 00:00:45.043
Lumen, show me. Whatever it is, I'm ready.

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:47.981
And the light remembered for her.

00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:10.071
Mira's father had a dream too. A dream of the stars.

00:01:25.400 --> 00:01:31.186
Dad. He used to say every star is a dream someone forgot to wake up.

00:01:42.800 --> 00:01:46.339
Some goodbyes are too big for a small heart.

00:01:52.400 --> 00:01:57.846
He gave me the lantern. Before he left. And I stopped dreaming.

00:02:28.700 --> 00:02:33.049
Mira? You're up again. Are you thinking about your father?

00:02:34.050 --> 00:02:39.026
I forgot him, Mom. I made myself forget, so it wouldn't hurt.

00:02:39.590 --> 00:02:45.036
Remembering hurts a little. But forgetting hurts more, sweetheart.

00:02:45.800 --> 00:02:50.854
Mira hadn't cried for her father in years. Tonight she did.

00:03:15.400 --> 00:03:19.984
Mira! Your window is glowing like crazy. Something's happening!

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:45.984
You were never just a dream, Lumen. You were my dad's star.

00:04:07.800 --> 00:04:10.529
She wasn't afraid of remembering anymore.

00:04:18.020 --> 00:04:23.200
Lumen trusts you now. But the Shadow waits at the Archive's heart.

00:04:34.140 --> 00:04:39.038
Then that's where we're going. Tonight, every dream comes home.

00:04:49.800 --> 00:04:52.138
The final night was here.

